"Check in with a past client": "与过去的客户联系",
"Hello {name}, we hope your project is going well. If you plan new work, we would be glad to price it.": "您好{name}，我们希望您的项目进展顺利。如果您计划新的工作，我们很乐意为其定价。",
"Ask a contact for a short call": "询问联系人进行简短通话",
"Hello {name}, it has been {days_since} days since we spoke. Do you have 10 minutes this week to talk about your plans?": "您好 {name}，距离我们通话已经过去 {days_since} 天了。这周你有 10 分钟时间谈谈你的计划吗？",
"Invite a decision maker to meet": "邀请决策者开会",
"Hello {name}, we would like to present our experience on similar projects. When can we meet at your office or on site?": "您好{name}，我们想介绍一下我们在类似项目上的经验。我们什么时候可以在您的办公室或建筑工地见面？",
"Acknowledge an enquiry": "确认询问",
"Hello, thank you for your enquiry about \"{project}\". We will review the documents and come back to you within two working days.": "您好，感谢您询问有关“{project}”的问题。我们将审核文件并在两个工作日内回复您。",
"Follow up an enquiry": "跟进询问",
"Hello, we are following up on \"{project}\". Can you confirm the tender deadline and send the drawings and the specification?": "您好，我们正在跟进“{project}”。你能确认投标截止日期并发送图纸和规格吗？",
"Ask for a site visit": "要求参观施工现场",
"Hello, to price \"{project}\" correctly we would like to visit the site. Which day and time suits you this week?": "您好，为了正确定价“{project}”，我们想参观施工现场。本周哪一天和时间适合您？",
"Decline to tender": "拒绝投标",
"Hello, thank you for inviting us to tender for \"{project}\". Our team is fully booked, so we must decline this time. We hope to work with you later.": "您好，感谢您邀请我们投标“{project}”。我们的团队已经订满了，所以这次我们必须拒绝。我们希望以后能与您合作。",
"Confirm a tender was submitted": "确认投标已提交",
"Hello, we submitted our tender for \"{project}\" with a price of {bid}. Please tell us when you expect a decision.": "您好，我们提交了“{project}”的投标，价格为 {bid}。请告诉我们您预计何时做出决定。",
"Ask a tender question": "问一个温柔的问题",
"Hello, we are pricing \"{project}\" and need an answer to a question about the drawings. The deadline is {deadline}. When can we talk?": "您好，我们的定价为“{project}”，需要回答有关图纸的问题。截止日期是{deadline}。我们什么时候可以谈谈？",
"Ask for more time": "要求更多时间",
"Hello, we ask for a short extension of the deadline of {deadline} for \"{project}\" so that we can price it with firm subcontractor quotes.": "您好，我们要求将“{project}”的最后期限 {deadline} 短暂延长，以便我们可以用确定的分包商报价对其进行定价。",
"Ask about the tender result": "询问招标结果",
"Hello, we are waiting for the result of the tender for \"{project}\" at {bid}. Is there any news or a question about our price?": "您好，我们正在{bid}等待“{project}”的招标结果。关于我们的价格有任何消息或疑问吗？",
"Thank a client for the award": "感谢客户的获奖",
"Hello, thank you for awarding us \"{project}\". We will send the contract documents and a start plan this week.": "您好，感谢您授予我们“{project}”奖。我们将在本周发送合同文件和启动计划。",
"Ask for a debrief after a loss": "损失后要求汇报",
"Hello, thank you for the chance to tender for \"{project}\". Could you tell us how our price compared and what we can do better next time?": "您好，感谢您给我们投标“{project}”的机会。您能告诉我们我们的价格相比如何以及下次我们可以做得更好吗？",
"Extend the validity of a price": "延长价格的有效期",
"Hello, our price of {bid} for \"{project}\" is still open. Please tell us if you need it to stay valid for longer.": "您好，“{project}”的 {bid} 价格仍未确定。如果您需要延长其有效期，请告诉我们。",
"Ask a subcontractor to quote": "请分包商报价",
"Hello, we invite you to quote for the {package} package of \"{proj}\". Please send your price by {valid} with your inclusions and exclusions.": "您好，我们邀请您对“{proj}”的{package}包进行报价。请在 {valid} 之前发送您的价格以及包含的内容和不包含的内容。",
"Remind a subcontractor of a quote": "提醒分包商报价",
"Hello, a reminder for your quote for {package} on \"{proj}\". We close our price soon. Can you send it today?": "您好，谨请注意您在“{proj}”上对 {package} 的报价。我们很快就关闭了价格。今天可以寄吗？",
"Tell a subcontractor you plan to use it": "告诉分包商您计划使用它",
"Hello, we plan to use your quote of {amount} for {package} on \"{proj}\" if we win the contract. We will send the subcontract soon.": "您好，如果我们赢得了合同，我们计划在“{proj}”上使用您对 {amount} 的报价来获得 {package}。我们将很快发送分包合同。",
"Tell a subcontractor they lost the quote": "告诉分包商他们失去了报价",
"Hello, thank you for quoting for {package} on \"{proj}\". We chose another quote this time. We will invite you again.": "您好，感谢您在“{proj}”上引用 {package}。这次我们选择了另一个报价。我们将再次邀请您。",
"Ask for a quote to stay valid": "索取报价以保持有效",
"Hello, your quote for {package} on \"{proj}\" ended on {valid}. Can you confirm that the price of {amount} still holds?": "您好，您对“{proj}”上的 {package} 的报价已于 {valid} 结束。您能否确认{amount}的价格仍然有效？"
}